  "originalQuery": "As a Database Engineer, you are tasked with designing a solution to synchronize data between two Firestore databases located in separate projects. The synchronization should be bidirectional, ensuring that any change made in one Firestore database is reflected in the other. Which of the following options is the most appropriate solution to achieve this goal?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Implement a Data Fusion pipeline to perform bidirectional synchronization between the two Firestore databases.<br/>B. Set up a Cloud Scheduler job to perform periodic exports and imports using the gcloud firestore export and gcloud firestore import commands.<br/>C. Configure Cloud Pub/Sub to capture updates in each Firestore database and trigger Cloud Functions to apply the changes to the other database.<br/>D. Use the gcloud firestore export command to export data from each Firestore database and the gcloud firestore import command to import data into the other database.",
