  "tip": "<p>When a question requires near real time and <i>two way</i> synchronization, look for an <i>event driven</i> pattern that uses triggers and messaging rather than batch jobs. Always verify <i>product support</i> for sources and sinks and confirm that the services can meet the stated latency.</p>",
